# The image needs source + lockfile, nothing else. This repo carries ~185 MB of test
# photographs and assorted test artefacts that must never enter the build context.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.data
images
docs
e2e
test-results
test-results-full-event
playwright-report
playwright*.config.ts
*.md
.env
.env.*

# Runtime state of the dev-stack scripts (pidfile, logs) and the scripts themselves. The image
# runs via docker/app.sh under supervisord, never ./dev.sh — the leading slash keeps this to the
# context root so docker/app.sh and docker/cloudflared.sh are still copied.
.dev
/*.sh
# ...except the boot scripts the app itself calls — db-provision.sh for DB_INIT=demo
# (ADR-249), db-reset.sh for DB_INIT_RESET=stale (ADR-264) — and the helpers they source.
# A script missing here never reaches the build context, so its Dockerfile COPY has
# nothing to copy and the boot dies with `No such file or directory` (ADR-316).
!/db-provision.sh
!/db-reset.sh
!/_dev-common.sh

# The build files themselves: changing a comment in one must not invalidate every cached layer.
Dockerfile
Dockerfile-prd
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.db.yml
